## Premium UI Design Notes

* Use **pure black (`#000000`)** for the background on OLED displays to maximize contrast and reduce power usage.
* Make the card color only slightly lighter than the background to create subtle depth.
* Limit the interface to **one accent color** to maintain a clean, high-end appearance.
* Use a soft white such as `#F5F5F7` instead of pure white for large text to reduce eye strain.
* Keep borders thin (1–2 px) in muted gray or graphite tones.
* Add gentle shadows or glows (5–10% opacity) rather than heavy effects.
* Use consistent spacing, balanced alignment, and restrained animations (150–250 ms) for a refined, premium feel.

